          "text": "For hydration before a 5km run, drink water steadily in the hours leading up to your run, and if you have a sensitive stomach, consider watered-down sports drinks or all-natural options. If you have food allergies or sensitivities, stick to bland, carb-based snacks and avoid high-fiber, high-fat, or unfamiliar foods before running. Are you interested in post-run recovery nutrition tips?",
