            "clueweb22-en0040-46-18574:1": 0.03252247488101534,
            "clueweb22-en0040-46-18574:0": 0.025232198142414862,
            "clueweb22-en0038-52-20255:10": 0.023343766301512782,
            "clueweb22-en0041-47-05546:9": 0.022753716871363933
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "I am not very confident in my fitness level.",
            "I live in Spain."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Not quite what I meant\u2014I wanted more general info about running shoes, like what features to look for and maybe what to avoid. Especially if you tend to be disappointed with some brands. Could you go into a bit more detail?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "When choosing running shoes, prioritize comfort, fit, support, and cushioning, and avoid shoes that feel tight or unsupportive. Consider brands with high customer satisfaction if you've been disappointed with Nike. Would you like recommendations for specific running shoe models?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0017-51-11925:1": 0.03455901528190685,
            "clueweb22-en0040-46-18574:0": 0.021708683473389355,
            "clueweb22-en0032-86-15272:0": 0.018957771787960466,
            "clueweb22-en0007-99-12703:2": 0.018614718614718615
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "I am not very confident in my fitness level.",
            "I often very disappointed with Nike product."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful\u2014thanks. Actually, are there mistakes people often make when picking out running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Many beginners make the mistake of picking running shoes based solely on their usual shoe size, but it's important to size up at least half a size to prevent issues like losing toenails, as feet swell during running [clueweb22-en0012-29-00139:4]. Comfort and fit are crucial\u2014there should be a thumb's width of space between your toes and the end of the shoe, and the shoe should support your foot's natural movement and pronation [clueweb22-en0004-94-13132:12]. Avoid buying shoes just for their looks or from large chain stores; instead, visit a specialty retailer where experts can assess your foot shape and running style for the best match [clueweb22-en0014-95-05002:1]. Lastly, wearing the wrong shoes can lead to joint pain and muscle aches, so always prioritize quality and listen to your body's feedback [clueweb22-en0027-31-13974:13]. Do you want tips for breaking in new running shoes?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0027-31-13974:13": 0.027402402402402402,
            "clueweb22-en0004-94-13132:12": 0.02429667519181586,
            "clueweb22-en0012-29-00139:4": 0.01639344262295082,
            "clueweb22-en0014-95-05002:1": 0.01639344262295082
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": [
