      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking into how to get ready for a run\u2014any tips?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I prepare to run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Before a run, it's best to eat something that includes complex, slow-releasing carbohydrates for energy. Some great options include oat cakes with peanut butter and an apple, a banana with yoghurt, or a small bowl of pasta with sauce. Avoid foods high in fructose",
          "citations": {
