      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Good to know! Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Good running shoes are essential for comfort, injury prevention, and effective training. It's best to buy them from a specialty retailer where you can talk to a specialist about your specific feet and the types of runs you want to do. They can help you find the right shoes. Quality running shoes are worth the expense, and you should consider getting fitted at a local running store. The knowledgeable staff there can help determine the right shoe for you.  Additionally, you can also consider cross-training activities to complement your running and reduce the risk of injury. Finding a cross-training activity you like and planning for it can be helpful.  Good socks are also important, and when you first begin, regular socks will be excellent for your runs. However, as you progress, you may want to consider specialized running socks for added comfort and support.  Ultimately, the right gear, including good running shoes and socks, can make a big difference in your running experience and help you achieve your goals.  You can also",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0040-23-14068:2": 5.886462211608887,
