      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful. Are there brands you recommend? I\u2019ve had bad luck with Nike so far.",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I adjust my workout plan for a 5km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "There are several good brands out there. You might want to consider Asics, Brooks, or Saucony. They are known for their high-quality running shoes that provide comfort, support, and performance. If you're looking for something a bit more affordable, you could also consider Puma or FILA. They offer a range of running shoes that are both comfortable and budget-friendly. It's always a good idea to try on several different brands and styles to see what works best for you. Additionally, you may want to consider visiting a specialty running store where the staff can help you find the right shoe for your specific needs.",
          "citations": {
