      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, but the peanut butter bit won\u2019t work for me\u2014I\u2019m allergic. Do you have alternatives for something quick and safe to eat before running?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I prepare to run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "You can try alternatives to peanut butter like almond butter or jam on wholegrain toast. Bananas are also a great option as they are rich in potassium, fiber, and iron, making them a perfect pre-run snack. Additionally, you can opt for other fruits like apples or pears. These options are quick, easy, and safe for you to consume before a run, and they provide the necessary carbohydrates for energy.",
