      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great breakdown! Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "When it comes to running shoes, it's essential to prioritize comfort and support. Consider visiting a specialty running store where a knowledgeable staff member can help you find the right shoe for your foot type, running style, and personal preferences. They can also provide guidance on the best shoe for your specific needs, such as stability or motion control. Additionally, look for shoes with good arch support, cushioning, and a comfortable fit. As someone who's not very confident in their fitness level, it's crucial to invest in a good pair of shoes to help prevent injuries and make your running experience more enjoyable. Your grandpa, being a shoemaker, might have also emphasized the importance of a well-fitting shoe.",
          "citations": {
