            "clueweb22-en0039-05-10934:13": -1.7335679531097412,
            "clueweb22-en0013-28-05254:4": -1.9234442710876465
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful, thanks. I get disappointed with Nike products sometimes\u2014are there brands that are known for durable and comfy running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I adjust my workout plan for a 5km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Yes, there are several brands known for their durable and comfortable running shoes. Brooks and Saucony are two popular brands that offer a wide range of models with excellent cushioning and support. Brooks is known for its wide toe box, which provides a comfortable fit for many runners. Saucony, on the other hand, is famous for its casual shoes, but they also offer high-quality running shoes with a focus on comfort and support. Both brands have a strong reputation for durability, with some models lasting up to 500 miles or more. It's worth noting that everyone's foot shape and running style are different, so it's essential to try on several models and choose the one that feels most comfortable for you. You may also want to consider visiting a specialty running store for personalized advice and guidance. Additionally, you can look into other brands like Hoka One One, which is known for its max cushioning and comfortable ride. Ultimately, the best brand for you will depend on your individual needs",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0010-03-09518:10": 5.199342727661133,
            "clueweb22-en0024-14-15574:4": 3.9073727130889893,
