    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I want to know what I should do to prepare for a run. Any tips?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I prepare to run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "That's completely understandable! Not being confident in your fitness level is a common feeling, especially when it comes to running. Why don't we start with some smaller, low-impact activities like brisk walking or cycling? These can help you build up your endurance and confidence without putting too much strain on your body. We can",
