          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that\u2019s super helpful. How about what a typical week of workouts would be, if I\u2019m aiming for a 10 km run?",
          "user_rubrik": "What does a typical week of workout look like when preparing for a 10 km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "A typical weekly workout schedule for a 10 km run often includes 3-5 running days. These usually consist of easy-paced runs, a longer run to build endurance, and a speedwork session. Supplement your running with 1-2 strength training or cross-training sessions, and ensure you have 1-3 dedicated rest days for recovery. Plans vary based on your experience level, with beginners starting with fewer runs and more rest.",
