          "user_utterance": "Interesting. I\u2019ve actually had pretty bad experiences with Nike shoes\u2014what else could be good for runs?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I adjust my workout plan for a 5km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Given your past experiences with Nike, excellent alternatives for 10km training include Adidas (like the Ultraboost series), Hoka (such as Clifton 7 or Rocket X), and Asics (Metaspeed Sky or Gel-Nimbus 21). Other strong options are Saucony's Endorphin Pro for speed, New Balance's FuelCell models for performance, and Brooks Adrenaline GTS 21 for longer distances.",
