          "user_utterance": "I'm curious\u2014what's the best way to get ready for a run? Like, what should I do before heading out?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I prepare to run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To prepare for a run, fuel your body with a small, easily digestible meal or snack rich in carbohydrates 30 minutes to two hours beforehand, like a banana or oatmeal. Hydrate by drinking 8-16 ounces of water at least 30 minutes before. Always perform a dynamic warm-up for 5-15 minutes to prevent injuries. Lastly, wear breathable, layered clothing and well-fitted running shoes for comfort and safety.",
