      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I usually end up disappointed with Nike running shoes\u2014are there other brands you\u2019d recommend?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I adjust my workout plan for a 5km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Given your preference, several other excellent running shoe brands are available. For 10 km runs, consider **Asics**, with models like the Metaracer or Gel-Cumulus, known for good support and suitability for that distance. **Adidas** offers options like the Ultraboost or Solar Boost, which are also suitable for 10km. **Brooks** (e.g., Ghost 13, Adrenaline GTS) and **New Balance** (e.g., Fresh Foam 880 series, FuelCell RC Elite) are popular for their cushioning and stability. **Saucony** (e.g., Cohesion 13, Endorphin series) and **Hoka** (e.g., Clifton, Rocket X) are other highly-rated choices.",
