          "user_utterance": "Nice, makes sense. Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For a 10 km run, you'll want to consider both training and race-day shoes. Training shoes, like the Nike Pegasus line or Asics Gel-Cumulus, offer durability and cushioning for consistent mileage. For race day, lighter options designed for speed, such as the Nike ZoomX Streakfly or Nike Vaporfly Next%, are popular choices. Look for shoes that provide good cushioning and stability, and consider getting fitted at a specialized running store to find the best pair for your foot type and stride.",
