          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Alright, awesome! Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Running shoes are specifically designed to absorb impact, propel you forward, and prevent injury by offering features like cushioning, flexibility, breathability, and traction. They differ from walking or training shoes by focusing on forward motion, often having more heel cushioning and less overall flexibility. Types include road, trail, and race shoes, as well as categories like neutral, stability, and motion control, tailored to foot mechanics and pronation.",
