          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Hi! I want to know how to get ready before I go for a run. Any advice?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I prepare to run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Before a run, fuel your body with a carb-rich snack 30-60 minutes prior and hydrate well. Wear breathable, comfortable clothing and properly fitted shoes. Always perform a dynamic warm-up to prepare your muscles. For safety, consider reflective gear if running in low light, tell someone your route, and choose well-lit areas. Prepping your gear and clothes the night before can also streamline your morning.",
