          "user_utterance": "Love the detail. Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about running shoes?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "For 10k training, consider having both everyday training shoes and lighter racing shoes. Durable options like the Nike Air Zoom Pegasus 38 or Brooks Ghost 14 are great for daily mileage. For 10k races, lighter shoes such as the Nike ZoomX Streakfly or Nike Free RN 2018 are recommended. If on a budget, the Saucony Cohesion 13 is a good choice for 5k/10k runs.",
