      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Cool, cheers! I sometimes get really tired or bored during training runs. Any ideas for making them more interesting?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I adjust my workout plan for a 5km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "To make training runs more engaging, try running with a friend or group, listening to music, or exploring new routes. Vary your workouts with different types of runs like intervals or tempo runs. To combat fatigue, ensure you're well-hydrated, fuel with energy-boosting snacks like bananas, and consider interval training to improve endurance. Tracking progress in a journal can also boost motivation.",
