          "user_utterance": "Got it, thanks! What about for a whole week\u2014how would a typical workout plan look for someone training for a 10k?",
          "user_rubrik": "What does a typical week of workout look like when preparing for a 10 km run?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "A typical weekly 10k training plan often includes 3-5 runs, with rest and optional cross-training. For example, a common schedule features two easy runs, one speedwork session, one long run, and a recovery run. Beginners might focus on 3 runs weekly, incorporating strength and rest. More advanced plans involve 4-5 runs, mixing easy, tempo, interval, and long runs, plus dedicated rest days.",
